TITLE Albite kinetics with H2S gas at 200 C no pe
SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2
    units     mmol/kgw
    Fe(2)     4
    Fe(3)     4

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g)    5

KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0     1
        -m      1
        -parms  1.0 10
        -steps  1000 in 100
        -tol    1e-12

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected2.out
    -reset false
    -step true
    -time true
    -si Goethite
END
